{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_1.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_2.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_weapons.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_editor.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408170?t=1751684766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751684766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/0c74c01a5f3dadef2869afde2feaac62d7a5739f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751684766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/0c74c01a5f3dadef2869afde2feaac62d7a5739f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751684766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/discord.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the official Discord server to start beta testing!</strong> Check the links to the right --&gt;</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_1.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_2.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_weapons.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/banner_editor.png?t=1751684766\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wilkin Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/faccd19e43fb8910c033c7fa93151df53109f086/header.jpg?t=1751684766","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Wilkin Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155747,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akama